# Store text files with LF line endings in the repository and check them
# out with LF everywhere, so Windows and Linux edits don't show up as
# whole-file changes. Binary formats are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
